<title>FINLAND: UNIBANK TO OPEN IN FINLAND IN JANUARY.</title>
<headline>UNIBANK TO OPEN IN FINLAND IN JANUARY.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denmark's second biggest bank group Unibank said in a statement on Thursday it would open a representative office in Helsinki in January.</p>
<p>&quot;The representative office is due to be expanded into a branch during spring 1997,&quot; Unibank said.</p>
</text>
